    "durationMs": 365465,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully tested. Here's what I built:\n\n**Implementation**\n- **Laravel 11.57.1** scaffolded via Composer (deps installed in `vendor/`, nothing installed in start.sh)\n- `links` migration: unique `code` (varchar 20), `url` text, `clicks` counter — Eloquent `Link` model with an integer cast so clicks are real JSON numbers\n- `LinkController` with `store` / `index` / `show` / `redirect`; validation returns a flat `error` field: 422 for malformed JSON / bad URLs / bad codes, 409 for duplicate custom codes (plus a unique-index race backstop), 404 for unknown codes\n- URL validation requires an absolute `http`/`https` URL with a host (`filter_var` + scheme/host checks); submitted URLs are stored and echoed unchanged, and responses use `JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES` so the raw body carries the exact URL\n- Routes registered in `routes/api.php` with `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`, so paths are exactly `/links`, `/links/{code}`, `/r/{code}`\n- Redirects use `302` with the exact stored URL in `Location` and one atomic `clicks + 1` update\n\n**Configuration**\n- `.env` contains no DB settings at all — the app reads `DB_*` exclusively from the process environment (verified no credentials anywhere in the code)\n- `start.sh` (executable): `php artisan migrate --force`, then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload`, with 4 CLI server workers for concurrent clients\n- README includes the \"Starting the server\" section\n\n**Verified by tests (58/58 checks passing)**\n- Create with generated/custom codes, duplicate → 409, all invalid URL/code variants and malformed JSON → 422, unknown codes → 404 JSON\n- Redirect incremented clicks exactly once (1, 2, 3…), Location matched exactly including query and fragment\n- Listing returned ascending creation order with correct `total`\n- 120-request burst: zero 429s (no throttling)\n- Killed and restarted the server twice: all links and click counts survived\n- Test data cleaned afterwards — the harness starts with an empty table, migrations idempotent (\"Nothing to migrate\" on re-run), port 8000 left free"
  }
